main/lib/components/pcb-trace.ts)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e8ed2-c0fe-7f22-97fd-bed75b89d0f5","turnId":"019e8ed2-c10a-7b90-89ec-fc986554d7a9","completedAtMs":1780513176046}}
